#: includes/abilities/settings/class-set-link-settings.php:41
msgid "Updates site-wide link behavior: nofollow for external and image links, opening external links in a new tab, nofollow domain allow/exclude lists, category base stripping, and attachment page redirects. All fields are optional — omitted fields keep their current stored value."
